# Copy to .dev.vars for local `wrangler dev`. .dev.vars is gitignored.
# Names only. Do not commit real values.
#
# Required on Workers. Requests to /api are rejected until both are set.
# ACCESS_TEAM_DOMAIN is the team subdomain (your-team) or
# https://your-team.cloudflareaccess.com. ACCESS_AUD is the application AUD tag.
#
# ACCESS_TEAM_DOMAIN=
# ACCESS_AUD=
#
# Workers AI uses the AI binding. No model key goes here.
# Set these only when LLM_PROVIDER=ollama.
#
# OLLAMA_HOST=
# OLLAMA_API_KEY=
